<title>USA: Equity files for $500 mln stock offer.</title>
<headline>Equity files for $500 mln stock offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Residential Properties Trust filed Wednesday a shelf registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $500 million in preferred, common and depositary shares.</p>
<p>The company said net proceeds will be contributed to its operating partnership in exchange for additional interests in the partnership.</p>
<p>The partnership will use the funds for general business purposes, including repayment of debt and acquisition of multifamily residential properties, it said.</p>
</text>
